<title>USA: IntelliQuest Information Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>IntelliQuest Information Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited)    (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						For the three months</p>
<p>						   ended March 31,</p>
<p>					    1997	1996   % Change</p>
<p> Total Revenues			7,484     4,414	  70%</p>
<p> Total operating expenses	  7,296     4,198	  74%</p>
<p> Net income				583	 157	 271%</p>
<p> Net income per share		 0.07	0.03</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is IntelliQuest Information Group Inc.</p>
